      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree! Moreover, many VRC communities that do regular meetings and gatherings often ask to use optimized avatars to keep everyone's performance at the decent level. The ability to turn an impostor for everyone regardless of their settings and platforms would not only allow you to use your trademark avatar but also help you to keep the performance for the entire instance.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "69d741b60d1795ed740bb14b",
      "aiGenerated": false,
